              <tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink">YouTube Shorts</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">25&ndash;35%</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Higher intent audience, more competitive</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 border-b border-border text-ink-2">Educational hooks outperform pure curiosity hooks.</td></tr>
