        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">A hook that wins on one platform often works on others, but the <em>execution</em> must be adapted. A Meta hook that relies on text overlays needs to be re-produced with a stronger audio component for TikTok. A TikTok hook that relies on trending audio needs a visual substitute for Meta's sound-off environment. The insight (which message stops the scroll) transfers; the format must be platform-native.</p>
